@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-09
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-09 Experiment architecture\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nevaluator-only truth is never an algorithm input

rectangle "Controlled scene / config\n(IUT, fault plan, resource mode)" as Scene
rectangle "Independent truth record\n(evaluator only)" as Truth
rectangle "Comparison arms\nCL-T / CL-A / CL-TA / CL-LOOP" as Arms
rectangle "Observations and resource log\n(algorithm-visible)" as Obs
rectangle "Validity check\n(invalid, equivalent, missing)" as Valid
rectangle "Metrics with denominators\nEXP-CLTAV-DETECT / LOCATE / ABLATION" as Metrics
rectangle "RQ / claims\n(no unrun numbers)" as Claims

Scene --> Arms : same declared pool and action library
Scene --> Truth : injection plan + execution confirmation
Truth -[#red,dashed]-> Arms : forbidden leakage
Arms --> Obs : algorithm-visible Izk, q, cost
Obs --> Valid
Truth --> Valid : evaluator-only confirmation
Valid --> Metrics : attempt and answered-subset denominators
Metrics --> Claims : comparable projections only

note right of Truth
  Evaluator truth must not enter
  IF-SELECT-ADMIT, IF-PRED-OBS,
  IF-HIST-UPDATE or IF-EXECUTE-RECORD.
  IF-OBS-INTERPRET, IF-PREP-RECOVER,
  IF-EQUIV and IF-RESOURCE-STOP stay
  algorithm-visible only.
  Experiment I/O: IF-EXP-SCENE,
  IF-EXP-INJECT, IF-EXP-TRUTH,
  IF-EXP-COLLECT, IF-EXP-RUN,
  IF-EXP-FILTER, IF-EXP-EVAL.
end note
note bottom of Arms
  Same pool is not a gift of later CL-LOOP
  records to other arms, and not a fictional
  sampling charge to CL-A.
  Groups: EXP-CLTAV-DETECT, EXP-CLTAV-LOCATE,
  EXP-CLTAV-ABLATION.
end note
@enduml
